    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/c5cc20730e3f17a21ecff80c8eda0c4a.avif?t=1754655661\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Night Is Long</i> </strong>is a short\u00a0first-person\u00a0Lovecraftian inspired horror game that explores grief, guilt, and the chilling unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remake of a popular game jam game called Night Is Long on Itch.io</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/bbdf4c5275b35e408688ffbee786ca67.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/bbdf4c5275b35e408688ffbee786ca67.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of emotional turmoil, a grieving man sets out on a nighttime drive, desperate to escape the pain of his past. But when his deceased wife suddenly appears in the middle of the road, he swerves into the unknown \u2014 and follows her into a long-abandoned mansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/fdbeacbf95e94ddc3e57ac5a6f8a2f3b.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/fdbeacbf95e94ddc3e57ac5a6f8a2f3b.webm?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/fdbeacbf95e94ddc3e57ac5a6f8a2f3b.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, reality begins to unravel. The deeper he explores, the clearer it becomes: the night is long, and he is not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and determination to survive the horrors within and uncover the truth buried in the shadows of the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/74f7f6abf54538887497dcb6bbfa354b.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/74f7f6abf54538887497dcb6bbfa354b.webm?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/74f7f6abf54538887497dcb6bbfa354b.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotional, story-rich experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay with storytelling delivered through scattered notes and hand-drawn illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling atmosphere that builds psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random paranormal events to keep you constantly on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sanity system that dynamically affects ambient and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic key-hunting and inventory puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindful, well-placed jump scares that enhance atmosphere and tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/925e4e1837cbeab0830373d486533b40.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/925e4e1837cbeab0830373d486533b40.webm?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/925e4e1837cbeab0830373d486533b40.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/c5cc20730e3f17a21ecff80c8eda0c4a.avif?t=1754655661\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Night Is Long</i> </strong>is a short\u00a0first-person\u00a0Lovecraftian inspired horror game that explores grief, guilt, and the chilling unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remake of a popular game jam game called Night Is Long on Itch.io</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/bbdf4c5275b35e408688ffbee786ca67.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/bbdf4c5275b35e408688ffbee786ca67.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of emotional turmoil, a grieving man sets out on a nighttime drive, desperate to escape the pain of his past. But when his deceased wife suddenly appears in the middle of the road, he swerves into the unknown \u2014 and follows her into a long-abandoned mansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/fdbeacbf95e94ddc3e57ac5a6f8a2f3b.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/fdbeacbf95e94ddc3e57ac5a6f8a2f3b.webm?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/fdbeacbf95e94ddc3e57ac5a6f8a2f3b.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, reality begins to unravel. The deeper he explores, the clearer it becomes: the night is long, and he is not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and determination to survive the horrors within and uncover the truth buried in the shadows of the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/74f7f6abf54538887497dcb6bbfa354b.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/74f7f6abf54538887497dcb6bbfa354b.webm?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/74f7f6abf54538887497dcb6bbfa354b.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emotional, story-rich experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay with storytelling delivered through scattered notes and hand-drawn illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chilling atmosphere that builds psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random paranormal events to keep you constantly on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sanity system that dynamically affects ambient and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic key-hunting and inventory puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mindful, well-placed jump scares that enhance atmosphere and tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/925e4e1837cbeab0830373d486533b40.poster.avif?t=1754655661\" width=640 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/925e4e1837cbeab0830373d486533b40.webm?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795720/extras/925e4e1837cbeab0830373d486533b40.mp4?t=1754655661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Night Is Long is a short first-person horror game where a grieving man follows a ghostly vision into an abandoned mansion. Uncover dark secrets, survive atmospheric horrors, and face your past through exploration, puzzles, and subtle scares.",
